A window of the link and the key (Remember the key, as the Writer's OpenRouter one: this browser only; heresy-settings.js keeps yue2.civitaiKey out of user/settings.json, which the network can read). What the link names comes first: the adapter, its base model, its trigger words, its file and size, and where it goes (another family's adapter into that family's folder, said; a base no painter is known to take, warned; a checkpoint is no adapter, Fetch off). Fetch says its size; its progress and Stop while it runs; Fetched and a toast at the end (also when the window was closed before), Add it to the list for this painter's family; the library repainted. The window's words and the lab's in the six other languages (47 rows). The empty library says the way too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
